# Build context for Dockerfile.partner (BuildKit picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore over .dockerignore).
# Only apps/partner's sources go in; the root package, docs, infra and every node_modules stay out.
*
!apps/partner
apps/partner/node_modules
apps/partner/.next
apps/partner/.next-*
apps/partner/test-results
apps/partner/playwright-report
apps/partner/tests
apps/partner/walk-out
apps/partner/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/partner/.env*
